# Regenerable Unreal Engine build artifacts — forward-only ignore.
#
# Same policy as CraftBenchTemplate/.gitignore: stop build artifacts from
# being staged so real source/asset changes stop being buried in noise.

# UE-generated, rebuildable trees
Binaries/
Build/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/

# Visual Studio project files (regenerated by UE from the .uproject)
.vs/
.vsconfig
*.sln
*.slnx

# Plugins/ is reserved for host-local plugin clones (never committed on
# substrates; mirrors the CraftBenchTemplate policy).
Plugins/
